        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ashley Estes Kavanaugh, George W. Bush, Laura Bush, Brett Kavanaugh\n- Places: Georgetown, Washington, D.C., Potomac River\n- Roles: Personal Secretary to the President, federal judge, First Lady\n- Organizations: United States Court of Appeals for the D.C. Circuit\n\nFacts:\n- Ashley Estes Kavanaugh served as Personal Secretary to the President for U.S. President George W. Bush from 2001 to 2004.\n- Brett Kavanaugh was a federal judge on the United States Court of Appeals for the D.C. Circuit when he married Ashley Estes Kavanaugh.\n- George W. Bush and then First Lady Laura Bush attended Ashley Estes Kavanaugh's wedding ceremony to Brett Kavanaugh in Georgetown.\n- Georgetown is a historic neighborhood, commercial district, and entertainment district in northwest Washington, D.C.\n- Georgetown is situated along the Potomac River.",
